{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/45b46d31f221e0c610732e89a5788820.avif?t=1766926742\" width=600 height=112 /></span><br><strong>Mini Dash</strong> is a freaky, fast, funny and incredibly interesting platformer, the standard of quality for modern games of this genre. Filled with fun ideas and unexpected turns of events, this game is able to impress even the most skilled gamer!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/d0fef0ad5c29e6f0a066c12ab15b0881.avif?t=1766926742\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/f99de3f9a44a9eb1858717c102653742.poster.avif?t=1766926742\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/f99de3f9a44a9eb1858717c102653742.webm?t=1766926742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/f99de3f9a44a9eb1858717c102653742.mp4?t=1766926742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are at the crossroads of several worlds at once! Therefore, be careful, you will find unexpected traps and tricky constructions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/17d27093d0cd754b5e09d5d432207830.avif?t=1766926742\" width=600 height=48 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850650/extras/80df5629a22e9131b143b5ba15f197ac.poster.avif?t=1766926742\" width=598 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shar